title: The Strike Committee
subtitle: In one district the strike is wavering.
view-if: crisis_kapp = 1 and e20_kapp_committee_done = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.e20_kapp_committee_done = 1;
// the weakest point of the strike: a district that went back, or the least angry one still out
var pick = null, score = 1e9;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (d == 'bavaria') { continue; }
    var s = Q['district_' + d + '_militancy'] + (Q['district_' + d + '_strike'] ? 100 : 0);
    if (s < score) { score = s; pick = d; }
}
Q.e20_kapp_target = pick;
Q.e20_kapp_target_name = Q.district_names[pick];
Q.e20_kapp_target_out = Q['district_' + pick + '_strike'] ? 1 : 0;
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Strike Committee

[? if e20_kapp_target_out = 1 : In [+ e20_kapp_target_name +] the strike committee of the SPD, the USPD and the unions is losing its grip. The foremen are telling the men that the putsch is as good as over. ?][? if e20_kapp_target_out = 0 : In [+ e20_kapp_target_name +] the men have gone back to work, and the strike committee is still meeting, without a strike. ?] Our comrades there want to know what to do.

- @sit: Sit on the committee with the social democrats, and hold it together.
- @council: Turn the committee into an elected workers' council.

@sit
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] [+ e20_kapp_target_name +] stays out, or comes out again, and our voice in the strike grows.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids sitting with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
RG.startStrike(Q.e20_kapp_target, true);
RG.district(Q.e20_kapp_target, {loyalty: 6, militancy: 6});
Q.e20_kapp_voice = Math.min(2, Q.e20_kapp_voice + 1);
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Districts on strike: ' + Q.strike_count + ' of 8';
Q.crisis_line_2 = 'Our voice in the strike: ' + ['none', 'heard', 'leading'][Q.e20_kapp_voice];
!}

Our delegates run the pickets better than anyone, and the union men grudgingly say so.

@council
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The workers of [+ e20_kapp_target_name +] take the town hall and the food supply. The officials will be frightened.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
RG.startStrike(Q.e20_kapp_target, true);
RG.district(Q.e20_kapp_target, {militancy: 12, guards: 0.5, repression: 6});
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Districts on strike: ' + Q.strike_count + ' of 8';
!}

The big works elect delegates to a council of the whole town, and the council takes over the town hall.
